  "description": "Previously approved Application: 22/08504/FULL and 22/08505/LBC.\n\nThe purpose of the following application is to request the following amendments to the design proposals: \n - Alternative proposal for the Ground Floor circulation area of No.36 Grosvenor Gardens\n- Proposal to not introduce an additional staircase within the circulation area, which cannot be made to comply with modern safety regulations\n- Introduction of wainscoting and an internal Juliette balcony to celebrate the idea of the long-lost historical staircase \n\nThe proposed works outlined in this application predominantly are concerned with improving the existing condition of the building and carrying out required repairs with no harm to the existing fabric. The proposals also include improvements for safe access to and from the building - both for maintenance and for everyday use.",
